+# Plan
+
+## 1. Tests
+
+- [ ] 1.1 The stats card draws the rank circle in ring_color, and the api passes ring_color through (tests/renderStatsCard.test.js, tests/api.test.js) [AC-1]
+- [ ] 1.2 getCardColors returns ringColor from ring_color, else the theme, else the title color (tests/utils.test.js) [AC-2] [AC-3]
+- [ ] 1.3 Update the wakatime snapshot for the rank circle style (tests/__snapshots__/renderWakatimeCard.test.js.snap)
+
+## 2. Fix
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Read ring_color in the api and the stats card, and draw the rank circle with it (api/index.js, src/cards/stats-card.js, src/getStyles.js)
+- [ ] 2.2 Return ringColor from getCardColors, and let fallbackColor take a missing color (src/common/utils.js)
+- [ ] 2.3 Write the hex color pattern as one literal (src/common/utils.js)
+- [ ] 2.4 Document ring_color (readme.md)
